extends layout

block content
  section.hero
    h1 Welcome to the Rick and Morty Explorer
    p.
      Wubba lubba dub dub! This app pulls live data from the Rick and Morty API
      and renders it on the server with Express and Pug.
  ul.route-list
    li
      a(href='/characters') Characters
      span The first 100 characters with their picture, species, and status.
    li
      a(href='/species') Species
      span How many characters belong to each species, and who they are.
    li
      a(href='/locations') Locations
      span How many locations there are of each type.
